
  HANNAH Robot OS (experimental)

  NOT SAFETY CERTIFIED. The software stop (hannah-robot-os safety engage)
  is not a safety-rated emergency stop. A physical robot needs a hardware
  emergency stop circuit that cuts actuator power.

  The root filesystem is read-only; state lives in /var.
  Status:  hannah-robot-os ready --config /etc/hannah-robot-os/config.json
  Logs:    journalctl -u 'hannah-*'

